omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Brmv8m9fY-MQ7kNvwHz7Bzb&_nc_oc=AdqP0y4puuf_6ZFMVqX1cg8wDpuq6UnbWIFsfP6_6e_z1nbzcomQDmwVE5bVIeOTTVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF9iu831enysc7TxcsA4-GUJykPSu_E6HJKJqtHzGqT5w&oe=6A916F74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lMMYFuU214Q7kNvwF32HRj&_nc_oc=Adoflw2HXLrRZysVDsqFVhdk1aq4eq5eaY-7rCAyiXy0DcXJpkAXtWHFcz6rkydGL_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHOV3TrUMxVKYLR5Pv9IPldldU-_2pTs22RA7mf3ADfig&oe=6A9170D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkDiEU43a1cQ7kNvwEfnV2w&_nc_oc=AdpFmpIKgWorvFFeOFXUhLVLtEb9xWTj2OArSwvjG6jYtOlqlNQISu_k3ZcYy7TH9d8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEl7Zw3yoXtKXM76grzIayCAVuH4eVtmj8GvLQeignDQw&oe=6A9185F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://